      "limits": [
        "Both models here use BF16 parameter images cast to FP32. This flow observation is distinct from the newly tested unrounded FP32 master.",
        "The hidden gradient norm is sqrt of summed squares across 8 separate response activation tensors, including all prompt and response positions. It is not the norm of summed parameter gradients.",
        "Incoming gradient directions and forward hidden states differ between models. A large block input/output gain is not proof that this block parameter change alone caused the anomaly; it is not the block global operator norm.",
        "The chosen 8-response 517 micro was selected after seeing a large whole-micro gradient projection. These values are descriptive, not a population effect or a prospective warning test.",
        "Large hidden gradients show the effect is already visible before shared-parameter accumulation, but do not quantify how much final parameter-gradient growth comes from Jacobian geometry versus changed directions/coherence."
      ]
    },
    "additional_findings": [
      {
        "title": "实际反向传播中的方向增益。",
        "text": "同一旧8条回答与固定c，仍使用BF16参数像的FP32执行。重构517相对500的末层输出hidden梯度范数为2.29倍，第一层输入却为285.42倍。16–23层整段实际方向增益从5.68变为48.52，32–35层从1.49变为10.46；8–15层约1.80→1.80。因此8–15层MLP回退有效，不能直接理解成该段局部反向增益的贡献；前向状态与跨层交互也会改变。这里按8条回答的hidden梯度平方和聚合，参数梯度则跨回答求和，二者口径不同；这是特定方向的测量，不是全局Jacobian范数，也没有证明某一层自身更新独自致因。所有chosen logp、最终参数norm和相邻层边界检查均与原参考完全一致。",
        "figure": "fixed_probes/strong517_precision/backprop_flow/backprop_flow.png",
        "caption": "观察已存在的反向流，不修改梯度；每个hook恰好调用一次。两个点仍是BF16参数像，原始FP32 master对照单独列出。"
      },
      {
        "title": "幅度匹配随机扰动与未获支持的机制。",
        "text": "另行预先固定的Gaussian v2控制按每个张量的名义改变量生成噪声，再舍入到FP32，总改变量范数匹配；范数仍为489.287。极小张量的实际相对改变量会受舍入影响，因此不声称每个张量都精确等幅。此前v1在前向前校验失败，不计为结果。激活检查也没有支持“最终隐藏向量更集中”或“Q/K归一化输入跌到epsilon底部”这两个具体假设；其他分布式放大路径仍未排除。"
      }
    ]
